			title: "Paste From Coal And Clay"
			description: ["Three coal, two clay balls and a lava bucket make 24 Dielectric Paste.", "Paste is the base of every single thing Powah builds.", "", "Powah runs on Forge Energy, which on Fabric is the same Team Reborn Energy", "that QuarryPlus consumes and Flux Networks moves. One grid, three mods."]
