			id: "CF75248E1D558CF8"
			title: "The Manual And The Wrench"
			description: ["Paste plus a book gives you the Powah manual -- it has a page for every", "block, with the numbers. Read it instead of guessing at tiers.", "", "The Wrench has three modes, cycled by sneak-clicking: Rotate turns a block,", "Config edits cable and machine sides, Link re-pairs energizing rods to an orb."]
