			title: "Rods And Casings"
			description: ["Paste plus iron bars gives Dielectric Rods, eight at a time. Two shapes:", "the plain rod and the Horizontal rod. Recipes want a specific one.", "", "Rod + horizontal rod + iron makes a Dielectric Casing: the chassis every", "generator, cell and cable is built around."]
