			title: "Capacitors"
			description: ["Iron, redstone block and paste make four Basic Capacitors.", "One capacitor splits into two Tiny Capacitors.", "", "Tiny is what almost every starter recipe asks for. Make a stack of them", "now -- you will burn through them for the rest of the chapter."]
