			id: "53F9C2D7AAAA4B75"
			title: "Burn Something"
			description: ["The Furnator burns ordinary furnace fuel -- coal, charcoal, planks.", "", "Higher tiers make more FE/t and hold more, but they also burn the fuel", "faster for the same total energy. Tiering up buys throughput, not efficiency.", "", "This is your first real generator. Put a Jade tooltip on it and watch it fill."]
