			id: "2E5FBA945180E655"
			title: "Cells And Cable"
			description: ["Energy Cables move power between machines. Sneak-click a cable with the", "Wrench in Config mode to change what a side does.", "", "The Energy Cell buffers it. Generators stall when the thing they feed is", "full; a cell in between keeps them running flat out.", "", "Cable tier caps transfer rate. A starter cable will throttle a nitro reactor."]
