			description: ["Crystals are the tier ladder, and every one comes out of the orb.", "", "Four blaze powder at 120k FE gives a Blazing Crystal.", "One diamond at 300k FE gives a Niotic Crystal.", "", "Each machine tier is the previous tier's block plus that tier's crystal.", "You do not craft a Niotic Furnator from scratch; you upgrade one."]
