			description: ["A Battery charges anything chargeable while it sits in your inventory.", "", "The Energy Hopper does the same job for a chest: put it against an", "inventory and it tops up the charged items inside.", "", "Batteries also upgrade Ender Network channel capacity later -- keep them."]
