			id: "1FB79A8983F8673F"
			title: "Raw Uraninite"
			description: ["Uraninite ore generates in three grades: Poor below y64, normal below y20,", "Dense below y0. Iron pickaxe or better; Fortune multiplies the drop.", "", "Raw Uraninite smelts into Uraninite, or you can energize the ore block", "directly in the orb for five at a time.", "", "This is exactly the job the Chunk Destroyer exists for."]
