			id: "5E6493AE25815282"
			title: "Bound To You"
			description: ["The Player Transmitter charges everything in a linked player's inventory,", "armour and offhand included, anywhere in the same dimension.", "", "RIGHT-CLICK a Binding Card to bind it to yourself FIRST, then put the card", "in the transmitter. An unbound card does nothing and gives no error.", "", "The Dimensional Binding Card lifts the same-dimension limit."]
