			id: "61AA75EAEDAA0954"
			title: "Spirited And Nitro"
			description: ["One emerald at 1,000,000 FE gives a Spirited Crystal.", "", "Nitro is the wall: a nether star, two redstone blocks and a Blazing Crystal", "block at 20,000,000 FE -- for sixteen crystals. Budget a night of reactor", "uptime and a rod array that is not starter tier.", "", "Nitro tier machines are the endgame of this mod."]
