			y: 0.0d
			id: "B9E263FD4006D77D"
			title: "The Ender Network"
			description: ["Ender Cells store energy to a numbered CHANNEL on your own ender network,", "readable from any other Ender Cell anywhere in the world.", "", "A fresh channel has no capacity. Shift-click an Energy Cell or a Battery", "into the Ender Cell GUI to donate its capacity -- and its charge -- to the", "channel. That step is the one everyone misses.", "", "Ender Gates push and pull between the network and an adjacent block, but", "cannot add capacity."]
